Error [E0803]: `triple` is Scale, not a function
  --> tests/ui/call_struct_value.jet:15:11
    |
 15 |     print(triple(4))
    |           ^^^^^^
 Why: Parentheses call functions and lambdas only; `Scale` has the methods apply, as_fn
 Fix: Call one of its methods, such as `triple.apply(…)`, or write a method that returns a lambda
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0803
